  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU for Economic Cohesion &#xBF; MK2024AAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to contribute to unleashing sustainable economic potential of North Macedonia by accelerating business environment transformation and climate change-related structural reforms in the energy and agri-food sectors.To this end, the Action would:Output 1: Improve legal, administrative and operational framework for private sector developmentOutput 2: Strengthen the strategic, institutional, and operational capacity for effective energy policy in response to the climate changeOutput 3: Enable national policies for sustainable food system towards EU objectives for green agriculture</narrative>
  </description>
